# TypeScript / React

- Keep imports at the top of the file (no inline imports).
- Use exhaustive `switch` with a `never` check in the default case for union types.
- Match existing patterns: `@/` path alias, semantic `cursor-*` CSS tokens, tabs (width 2).
- Format with `pnpm format` (oxfmt) and lint with `pnpm lint` (oxlint) — not Prettier/ESLint.
- Client components use `'use client'` only when needed; prefer server components for static content.
